  "text_md": "Catalog Number:\n\n10333-MMO2\n\n<!-- image -->\n\nFlow cytometric analysis of human ICAM3(CD5O) expression on human peripheral blood lymphocytes. Cells were stained with purified anti-Human ICAM3(CD5O) , then a FITC-conjugated second step antibody The histogram were derived from events with the forward and side light-scatter characteristics of viable lymphocytes\n\nFlow cytometry was performed on a BD FACSCalibur flow cytometry system Please refer to WWW.sinobiological.comlFlow Cytometry-FACS-Protocols-a-750.html for technical protocols.\n\n<!-- image -->",
